build*/
twister-out*/
# on-device (HIL) suite output — run-device-tests.sh default --outdir, plus
# its sibling .last-markers tier stamp (a runtime artifact, never committed:
# a committed stamp defeats the --test-only guard on fresh clones)
twister-device-out*
# CI firmware size-report artifacts (fw_size_report.py / build.yaml)
build.log
size.json
baseline-size.json
size-comment.md
